{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-36155","model_call":48,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"mexican muralism\" \"mexican mural movement\") (+ \"new mexican society\" \"new society\" \"national identity\") (+ workers illiterate public))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"mexican muralism\" \"mexican mural movement\") (+ \"new mexican society\" \"new society\" \"national identity\") (+ workers illiterate public))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_57_1342511605#1_2485324887","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q162","rank":1,"snippet":"Mexican Muralism - Hand-in-Hand with Politics and People After the Mexican Revolution, which had dictator Porfirio Díaz and his regime overthrown, and the political turmoil that followed for the next few years, Mexico saw the creation of a new party, the Partido Revolucionario Institucional - the PRI. The land was finally in the hands of its own workers, but there was so much to be done: the new government sought to establish a brand <cover>new Mexican society, founded on its rich tradition but very much forward-looking. Since most of the population was illiterate, an effective way to change that would be through the creation of visual messages that would not only appeal aesthetically, but that would also promote certain ideals. And so, Mexican muralism </cover>became a vital part of the country’s new industrialist identity in the making, under the full support of those in charge of it. But despite this kind of groundbreaking endorsement, these murals were very controversial for their time, and they often included elements of Marxism. David Siqueiros - El pueblo a la universidad, la universidad al pueblo, 1952–1956 at National Autonomous University of Mexico Mural - The Characteristics and Significance Although the mural movement stretched ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_57_1342511605#1_2485324887","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":1469},"model_calls":48,"document_judgments":41,"relevance_3":25,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
